<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-TALLINNA LEASING JAN-MAY PROFIT 3.9 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-TALLINNA LEASING JAN-MAY PROFIT 3.9 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Panga Liising's current year profit rose by 800,000 kroons in May to 3.9 million kroons, it said on Monday.</p>
<p>Tallinna Panga Liising chairman Priit Poldoja told Reuters that the figure was unconsolidated.</p>
<p>&quot;The growth is satisfactory,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>Its leasing portfolio rose by six million kroons in May and totalled 185 million kroons at the end of month, Poldoja said.</p>
<p>Tallinna Panga Liising, the leasing subsidiary of Tallinna Pank , has also offices in Latvia and Lithuania.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
